# Everything in here is stored and checked out with LF line endings, whatever
# the machine's core.autocrlf says. This repo is edited from Windows, from WSL,
# and by Decap CMS through the GitHub API — which always writes LF — so without
# this a file's endings depend on who touched it last.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text, and must never be rewritten
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
